Error [E2414]: `#[Default(...)]` on `n` must be a compile-time constant
  --> tests/ui/serde_default_not_const.jet:11:5
    |
 11 |     #Default(live()) n: Int
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: a decode default is baked into the program, so its value has to be known at compile time; this expression can only be computed at runtime
 Fix: use a literal or a `comptime`-evaluable expression — e.g. `#[Default(8080)]`, `#[Default(Color.Red)]`, or `#[Default([1, 2])]`
